==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 28.33~30 seconds<sup>850f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 28.33~30 seconds<sup>850f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 18.33 seconds<sup>550f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] (400%) spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] (200%) spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can bring along some [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] cats (e.g. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]], [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]]) to deal with the Doge Darks and Gory Darks. A stack of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]], more often than not, is enough to keep pushing back the Dark enemy units. Just remember to protect your Paris Cats with your meatshields.

